@prefix kg: <https://example.org/kg/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

kg:BillingOntology a owl:Ontology .
kg:amount a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain kg:Invoice .
kg:currency a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain kg:Invoice .
kg:dueDate a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain kg:Invoice .
